{"id":28499,"slug":"the-kid-brother","title":"The Kid Brother","year":1927,"country":"United States","duration":82,"spine":964,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28499-the-kid-brother","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/4b81c33aa97a34e6468805d64920da24/M921R58LZngKVnsquGrfhJqCBnRw40_large.jpg","description":"\nSilent-comedy legend Harold Lloyd goes west in this irresistible blend of action, romance, and slapstick invention. The bespec­tacled everyman is at his inimitable best as Harold Hickory, the gentle son of a prominent lawman who lives in the shadow of his rough-and-tumble brothers. When a traveling medicine show rolls into town, it brings with it excitement, the possibility of love, and a chance for Harold to prove his mettle. Deftly balancing Lloyd’s brilliant sight gags and thrilling set pieces—including an epic, knock-down, drag-out fight aboard an abandoned ship—with one of the actor-filmmaker’s most fully realized, root-for-the-underdog narratives, The Kid Brother is a hilarious and heartwarming high-water mark of early screen comedy.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ted Wilde","slug":"ted-wilde"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Harold Lloyd","role":"Harold Hickory","slug":"harold-lloyd"},{"actor":"Jobyna Ralston","role":"Mary Powers","slug":"jobyna-ralston"},{"actor":"Walter James","role":"Jim Hickory","slug":"walter-james"},{"actor":"Leo Willis","role":"Leo Hickory","slug":"leo-willis"},{"actor":"Olin Francis","role":"Olin Hickory","slug":"olin-francis"},{"actor":"Constantine Romanoff","role":"Sandoni","slug":"constantine-romanoff"},{"actor":"Eddie Boland","role":"Flash Farrell","slug":"eddie-boland"},{"actor":"Frank Lanning","role":"Sam Hooper","slug":"frank-lanning"},{"actor":"R. Yearsley","role":"Hank Hooper","slug":"r-yearsley"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ted Wilde","slug":"ted-wilde"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Harold Lloyd Corporation","slug":null},{"role":"Codirected by","person":"J. A. Howe","slug